{"asset_key":"mn3/env_story_10357070","episode":"mn3","category":"env_story","story_id":"10357070","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1035707001:1":{"text":"왜냐고요? 그거야 당연히 그 성당 녀석들 때문이죠!","source_cn":"为什么？当然是因为圣堂那群家伙了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCCD806BFA6C4F70E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1035707002:1":{"text":"전 그냥 기도를 했을 뿐인데, 그 녀석들이 저더러 탐욕으로 여신을 모욕한다잖아요!","source_cn":"我只是正常祈祷，他们却说我是在用贪婪亵渎女神！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5FAD362BCD4B3F45","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1035707003:1":{"text":"위선자들! 제가 장담하는데, 여신님이 그들의 소원을 들어준다고 하면 그들은 분명 부자가 될 기회를 놓치지 않을 거예요!","source_cn":"装模作样！我敢保证，如果女神能实现他们的愿望，他们才不...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAC7B363ADE5510CD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:黑金商人希尔":{"text":"블랙골드 상인 힐","source":"黑金商人希尔","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":4,"localized_text_count":3,"speaker_count":1}}